    <!-- About this experience -->
    <div class="mt-12">
      <h3 class="text-2xl text-navy mb-4">About this experience</h3>
      <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed text-base">
        Join our popular sunset sailing tour and experience the magic of Cabo San Lucas as day turns to night. Sail past the famous Arch, toast with fellow adventurers, and watch one of the world's most spectacular sunsets from the deck of a beautiful sailing yacht. Our experienced bilingual crew ensures your comfort throughout the journey.
      </p>
    </div>

