      </div>
      <ol class="relative border-l-2 border-gold/30 ml-2 space-y-5 pl-6">
        <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">1</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Meet at the marina &amp; board the sailing yacht</span></li>
        <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">2</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Cruise past Cabo's highlights &mdash; the Arch, sea lions, and Lover's Beach</span></li>
        <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">3</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Settle into the best views as the sun begins to drop</span></li>
        <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">4</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Enjoy golden hour with unlimited drinks and light bites</span></li>
        <li class="relative"><span class="absolute -left-[33px] top-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-navy text-white text-[11px] font-bold flex items-center justify-center">5</span><span class="text-slate-600 text-base">Watch the sun set over the Pacific, then cruise back along the coastline</span></li>
      </ol>
      <p class="mt-5 text-slate-700 italic text-sm">No rush. No fixed script. Just a relaxed, beautiful time on the water.</p>
    </div>

